.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-backup-space-delete - Cancel (delete) a backup space


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro backup-space delete  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Cancel (delete) a backup space

.PP
\fBconfirm=true\fR is required. \fBimmediate=true\fR cancels now: SFTP access stops and the space with EVERY file in it is deleted permanently within about a minute (no snapshot, no grace period; cannot be undone). Without \fBimmediate\fR a cancellation request is filed and the space keeps working until it is processed. 403 \fBimmediate_disabled\fR when the operator turned immediate deletion off.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/backup-spaces/{id} (operationId deleteBackupSpace, scope cloud_delete)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--immediate\fP[=false]
	delete the space and every file now (cannot be undone)


